  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Now on solving,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;we get intersecting point of the curves as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>Now plotting the diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9bd57b61-d058-4515-8af2-fcd621dfe142-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 207px;\" /></p><p>So, from above diagram area of required region will be,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><msqrt><mi>y</mi></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8901;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></msup></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
